WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:02.159
We give our best people,

00:00:02.239 --> 00:00:04.920
for values, for rights, for freedom,

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.639
just for the desire to be equal, the same as you,

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:10.319
the same as everyone.

00:00:10.319 --> 00:00:12.000
We give our best people,

00:00:12.079 --> 00:00:17.959
the strongest, bravest, most incredible Ukrainians.

00:00:23.759 --> 00:00:28.519
I am talking today and now about my fellow citizens,

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:30.000
the citizens of Ukraine,

00:00:30.079 --> 00:00:33.319
who defend values and freedom

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:41.600
at the cost of their lives.

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:45.119
I am glad that we have united all of you,

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.959
all the countries of the European Union,

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.920
but I did not know this would be the price.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.839
And this is a tragedy for me, for each Ukrainian,

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:57.920
a tragedy for our country.

00:00:58.079 --> 00:00:59.839
The price is extremely high,

00:01:00.239 --> 00:01:03.839
thousands of people were killed.

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:07.879
No one will break us, we are strong.

00:01:08.119 --> 00:01:09.400
We are Ukrainians.

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:15.079
You know, we have a desire for our children to live.

00:01:16.319 --> 00:01:21.039
Yesterday, 16 children died.

00:01:22.079 --> 00:01:25.000
Once again, President Putin will say that

00:01:25.079 --> 00:01:26.879
this is some sort of operation,

00:01:26.959 --> 00:01:30.879
and "we are hitting the military infrastructure."

00:01:31.759 --> 00:01:34.439
And now, we are fighting for survival,

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:38.039
and this is our greatest motivation.

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:43.119
But we are also fighting to become

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:46.079
equal members of Europe.

00:01:46.839 --> 00:01:54.079
I believe that today we are showing everyone that we are.

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:59.600
With us, the European Union will definitely be stronger.

00:02:01.319 --> 00:02:06.159
Without you, Ukraine will be alone.

00:02:07.519 --> 00:02:09.720
We have proved our strength.

00:02:09.879 --> 00:02:17.519
We have proved that we are at least the same as you.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:20.800
Prove that you are with us.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:25.920
Prove that you are not letting us go.

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:30.759
Prove that you are truly European.

00:02:31.159 --> 00:02:35.000
And then life will overcome death,

00:02:35.079 --> 00:02:37.759
and light will overcome darkness.

00:02:37.759 --> 00:02:39.400
Glory to Ukraine!

